@startuml 01-context
' Presentation artifact: docs/diagrams/01-context.svg (hand-authored for GitHub).
' This .puml is a structural sketch only — prefer editing the SVG for layout.
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction
title Context — Weather Activity Ranking Service

actor Client
rectangle "Activity Ranking Service\n(Node.js / TypeScript)" as App
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
cloud "Open-Meteo" as OM

Client --> App : GraphQL + health
App --> PG : warm path
App ..> OM : refresh + cold-start

@enduml
